<media:description>OHHHH SINCE WE LAST SPOKE!!🍿🥤 🔥 MELANIA TRUMP & EPSTEIN BOMBSHELL Melania Trump just stepped in and completely flipped the Epstein conversation back into the spotlight… calling for survivors to PUBLICLY testify in front of Congress. She denied any connection to Epstein, shut down rumours, and then dropped the biggest line of all… suggesting he didn’t act alone 👀 which directly contradicts previous FBI statements. If this actually turns into a hearing… this could get VERY messy, VERY fast. 🐒 CHIMP “CIVIL WAR” IN UGANDA This might be one of the craziest things you’ll hear all week… scientists have confirmed a full-blown chimpanzee civil war in Uganda 😳 the largest group of wild chimps ever recorded has split into factions and are now carrying out coordinated attacks… including killings and kidnappings. Researchers are literally comparing it to human warfare… and saying this type of event might only happen once every 500 YEARS. 💥 TRUMP TURNS ON HIS OWN ALLIES Trump has gone absolutely OFF on some of his biggest former supporters… posting a brutal rant targeting Tucker Carlson, Candace Owens, Alex Jones and Megyn Kelly. We’re talking “low IQ,” “losers,” “needs a psychiatrist”… yeah, he did not hold back. This comes after many of them started criticising him publicly… and now it’s turned into full-on chaos between some of the biggest voices in conservative media. 📱 WHATSAPP PRIVACY LAWSUIT DRAMA If you use WhatsApp… this might concern you 😬 Meta is facing a lawsuit claiming private messages were accessed by employees and third-party companies like Accenture. The BIG issue? WhatsApp has always claimed end-to-end encryption means “no one” can read your messages… not even them. Meta says the claims are “categorically false”… but if proven true, this could be one of the biggest privacy scandals in tech. 🚛 IRELAND FUEL PROTESTS ESCALATE Things are getting serious in Ireland right now… farmers and truck drivers are blocking roads, oil terminals, and major infrastructure to protest sky-high fuel prices ⛽ Some reports say up to HALF the country’s fuel supply has been disrupted. There’s even been a request to deploy the army. Protesters say they’re not backing down… and this is all being driven by some of the highest fuel taxes in Europe. 🐶 250 DOGS FOUND IN ONE UK HOME This one is actually insane… over 250 dogs discovered inside a single UK property 😳 The image was so wild the RSPCA had to confirm it wasn’t AI. Authorities say the situation spiralled out of control due to breeding… and cases like this have reportedly risen by 70% in recent years. Honestly, just tragic. Let me know your thoughts on all of this… because some of these stories are getting seriously out of hand 😭👇 00:00 - TAKE YOUR SLOP PEASANTS! 01:08 - CHIMP WAR 05:18 - Melania press conference 10:02 - Trump blasts former allies 13:06 - whatsapp lawsuit 15:09 - IRELAND FUEL CRISIS 17:50 - 250 DOGS 19:51 - TODAY IN HISTORY - BUT YESTERDAY 21:14 - THE NEW WHIP</media:description>
