<media:description>OHHHH SINCE WE LAST SPOKE… this might genuinely be one of the most chaotic updates yet 😭 IRAN CEASEFIRE CHAOS Okay guys… the last 48 hours have been an absolute rollercoaster. We went from waiting on Donald Trump threatening to end a “whole civilization”… to waking up the next morning thinking… wait… peace?! Because just TWO HOURS before his deadline, the US and Iran agreed to a two-week ceasefire. The US would stop bombing, Iran would reopen the Strait of Hormuz… oil prices dropped… everyone started claiming victory… it actually looked like things were calming down. They were even planning proper negotiations in Pakistan with officials potentially including JD Vance. BUT THEN… Out of nowhere, Israel launched its largest strikes on Lebanon since the war began… on DAY ONE of the ceasefire. Around 100 targets hit… including areas in Beirut… hundreds killed and injured. And now everything is just… confusion. Some countries say Lebanon WAS part of the ceasefire. Israel says they weren’t. Even Hezbollah appeared to think they were. There might not have even been a proper written agreement. So now we’re in this weird situation where a ceasefire technically exists… but no one fully agrees on what it actually means. Only good sign? For the first time since the war started… no overnight strikes in parts of the Gulf. But honestly… by the time this video goes live, this could all flip again. BILL GATES EPSTEIN TESTIMONY Also since we last spoke… Bill Gates has officially been summoned to testify before Congress about his links to Jeffrey Epstein. This is happening in June, and he’s said he’s willing to cooperate fully. Now obviously… this is going to bring up a lot of uncomfortable questions. His past meetings with Epstein… those controversial reports… everything is likely going to get dragged back into the spotlight. But based on previous hearings with other high-profile names… don’t expect anything too explosive to actually come out of it. Still… the fact this is continuing shows the Epstein situation is FAR from over. ## **NORTH KOREA HACKER EXPOSED 😭** Alright this one is hilarious. There’s been a growing issue of North Koreans applying for remote tech jobs pretending to be Americans. So one founder came up with a genius test… He asks applicants to insult Kim Jong Un. If they panic… disconnect… or refuse… yeah… you know what’s going on 😭 And there’s now viral clips of this happening in real time… guys just immediately losing connection when asked to say anything negative. I’m not gonna lie… that might be the most effective interview filter I’ve ever seen. THAILAND CONSCRIPTION LOTTERY Speaking of military stuff… Thailand’s system is INSANE. Every year, men aged 21 draw a random card. Red = you’re drafted for up to 2 years Black = you’re free And the reactions are wild… People celebrating like they just won the lottery… others collapsing when they get drafted. Honestly… I’d be shaking 😭 NASA “FAKE” CLAIMS And yes… as expected… the internet is now claiming the Artemis II mission is fake. People are pointing to “green screen glitches”… weird visuals… missing stars… But most of this has already been explained — including broadcast overlay errors and straight up AI images being shared as “proof.” So right now… this is just classic internet conspiracy chatter. (Sorry Alex.) US MEN AUTO-DRAFT REGISTRATION** Now this one sounds scary… but it’s not what people think. The US is introducing automatic registration for the Selective Service System. Men already had to register manually at 18… Now the system will just do it automatically. So it’s not a new draft… just removing the step of signing yourself up. Still… the timing with everything going on right now is definitely raising eyebrows. ## **US VS VATICAN BEEF 😭** And finally… this might be the most unexpected one of all. There are reports of tension between the US government and the Vatican. Apparently a Pentagon official had a heated meeting with a representative of Pope Leo XIV… With claims he basically told them the US can do whatever it wants militarily and the Church should support it. Some reports even say Vatican officials were so concerned they cancelled plans for a US visit. BUT… US officials are denying all of this, saying the meeting was respectful. So right now… it’s one side vs the other. You decide who you believe. 00:00 - Introducing 01:01 - War Updates 06:43 - Epstein updates 08:27 - North Korean hacker detector 11:17 - Conscription lottery time 12:50 - The Moon deniers 17:38 - Automatic enlistment time 19:07 - Holy Beef 21:18 - today in history 22:02 - The Giveaway!</media:description>
